    "Goal: Practice print() and variable basics.\n",
    "\n",
    "Exercise:\n",
    "\n",
    "Create variables: name, age, height.\n",
    "\n",
    "Print them in a sentence.\n",
    "\n",
    "Change age and print again."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "daab0a44-6e6c-408a-b2e1-9caf2629b1b9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Example output:\n",
    "\n",
    "My name is Alex\n",
    "\n",
    "I am 30 years old\n",
    "\n",
    "My height is 175.5\n",
    "\n",
    "Next year I will be 31"
   ]
